! X resources for the desktop session (installed as ~/.Xdefaults via
! /etc/skel, alongside .mwmrc).
!
! WHY ~/.Xdefaults AND NOT xrdb: Xt loads this file directly whenever the
! root window has no RESOURCE_MANAGER property. Nothing in the session sets
! one (xinitrc.desktop runs no xrdb), so this is read as-is and the image
! needs no extra package. If an xrdb call is ever added to xinitrc.desktop,
! RESOURCE_MANAGER starts existing and this file is silently ignored — load
! it explicitly (`xrdb -merge`) at that point.
!
! .mwmrc holds menus and bindings; everything below is appearance/behavior.
! mwm reads these once at startup: "Restart mwm" (f.restart) re-reads .mwmrc
! but NOT resources, so a resource change needs a new X session.

! --- Window frames ---------------------------------------------------------
! Focused window: blue accent, so the input focus is obvious under
! click-to-focus. The shadow pair is what gives Motif its bevel; Motif would
! derive it from the background on its own, but the derived values wash out
! on dark colors, so both are set explicitly.
Mwm*client*activeBackground:            #2d5c8a
Mwm*client*activeForeground:            #f2f4f7
Mwm*client*activeTopShadowColor:        #4a83bb
Mwm*client*activeBottomShadowColor:     #16324c

! Unfocused windows: neutral slate, a step above the grey25 root.
Mwm*client*background:                  #4a4f57
Mwm*client*foreground:                  #c3c8d0
Mwm*client*topShadowColor:              #6b7079
Mwm*client*bottomShadowColor:           #2b2f35

! --- Menus (root menu and window menu) -------------------------------------
Mwm*menu*background:                    #3a3f47
Mwm*menu*foreground:                    #e6e9ee
Mwm*menu*topShadowColor:                #565c66
Mwm*menu*bottomShadowColor:             #23262b
! The highlighted entry reuses the focused-frame accent.
Mwm*menu*activeBackground:              #2d5c8a
Mwm*menu*activeForeground:              #ffffff

! --- Icons (mwm minimizes to root-window icons, there is no taskbar) -------
Mwm*icon*background:                    #4a4f57
Mwm*icon*foreground:                    #c3c8d0
Mwm*icon*topShadowColor:                #6b7079
Mwm*icon*bottomShadowColor:             #2b2f35
Mwm*iconImageBackground:                #3a3f47

! --- Move/resize feedback box ----------------------------------------------
Mwm*feedback*background:                #3a3f47
Mwm*feedback*foreground:                #e6e9ee

! This is the session's whole resource database, so app resources (XTerm*...)
! belong here too. Deliberately none for now: the e2e render check asserts a
! grayscale stddev over the screendump (ci/vm/vm-e2e.sh), and darkening the
! xterms toward the grey25 root eats into that margin for no functional gain.
